STEP 4[1C— Write[5Cdesign[1Cbrief, and[1CSTOP.[1CDo NOT try to run the `design` skill yourself: it is reserved for explicit user invocation and the Skill tool will refuse it. I will [3;3Hrun it for you the moment your brief is on disk.[39m[4;3H[177X[38;2;255;255;255m
Write the brief to `plays/001-project-s[1Cructur[1C/design/brie[1C.md` — o[1Ce shor[1C paragraph[1Con what the produ[1Ct[1Cis, who it[1Cis for and the look and feel it [1Chould have, then one line [6;3Hpe[1C new[1Cscreen naming it [1Cnd saying what it[1Cdoes. Brief it from intent.md,[1Cthe pro[1Cuct vision and the tec[1C stack, and look at the attached[1Crepositories first:[1Cif this product [7;3Halready[1Ch[1Cs a[1Cfrontend, say so and name i[1Cs real colours, type and spacing so the design matches rather than inventing a new look. End the brief by saying the canvas payload [8;3Hmust be saved as `plays/001-project-structure/design/canvas.html`.[39m[9;3H[176X[38;2;255;255;255m
