STEP 5 — Once the design skill has produced the canvas,[1Cleave the[1Cdesign[1Cin two places, both of[1Cwhich matter:[65X[14;3H1. `plays/001-[1Croject-s[1Cructure/design/design.md` — the published canvas URL, then one line per screen saying what it is and what it does. The Planner and the Developer read [15;3Hthis file; keep it short and factual.[140X[16;3H2.[1C`docum[1Cntation/design/001-proj[1Cct-structure-prototype.ht[1Cl` — [1Cow I actually LO[1CK [1Ct the prototype, from the Documentation tab of the proj[1Cct screen. Cre[1Cte the folde[1C if[1Cit [17;3His not there. This file is rendered inside a sandboxed ifram[1C with NO scripting, NO n[1Cviga[1Cion and NO network,[2Co it must[1Cbe[1CONE self-cont[1Cined page: [1Cvery[1Cartboard's markup    [18;3Hstacked[1Cone under a[1Cother[1Cwith a he[1Cding naming[1Cthe[1Cscreen, every style inline or in a[1C`<[1Cty[2C>` block[1Cin th[1Ct[1Csame file,[1Cno script tags, and n[1C references to any external[1Cfile,[19;3Hf[1Cnt[1Cor im[1Cge (inline any image as a[1Cdata URI). Put the c[2Cvas URL[1Cat the[1Ctop as plain visible text as well as a link — a link alone cannot be opened from that sandbox. Do NOT [20;3Hcopy the canvas payload itself here; it needs JavaScript and would render as a blank page.[39m[21;3H[177X[38;2;255;255;255m
